  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="63.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Northu">Northu</ref> 63.1</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="63.1" corresp="#wit-d">⁊ gif hi on ða<hi rend="italic">m</hi> geendigan buton geswicennesse, þolian clænes legeres ⁊ Godes mildse.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#whitelock" corresp="#wit-d">And if they die in that [sin] without desisting from it, they are to forfeit Christian burial and God's mercy.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#rabin" corresp="#wit-d">And if they die without putting an end to that, let them be deprived of Christian burial and God's mercy.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">Und wenn sie in dem [Sündigen] enden ohne Abstehen [davon], sollen sie ehrliches Grab und Gottes Gnade verlieren.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">And if they end [their lives] in that [sin] without ceasing [from it], let them lose burial in consecrated ground and God's mercy.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
